RUNNR   2                              run number
EVTNR   1                              number of first shower event
NSHOW   600                            number of showers to generate
PRMPAR  14                             primary particle (proton)
ESLOPE  -2.7                           slope of primary energy spectrum
ERANGE  1.E5  1.E5                     energy range (100 TeV in GeV)
THETAP  60.  60.                       zenith angle (degrees)
PHIP    0.  0.                         azimuth angle (degrees)
OBSLEV  0.                             observation level (cm, sea level)
MAGNET  17.5  42.6                     Earth magnetic field (μT)
HADFLG  0  0  0  0  0  2              hadronic interaction flags
ECUTS   1.  1.  1.  1.                energy cuts (GeV, all particles)
HILOW   63.1                           transition energy (GeV)
ELMFLG  F   T                          EM interaction flags (NKG, EGS)
STEPFC  1.0                            step size factor
LONGI   T  10.  T  T                   longitudinal distribution
MAXPRT  1                              max printed events
DIRECT  ./Earth_results/               output directory
USER    user
ATMOD   0                              input-based atmosphere (J=0 defaults)
ATMLAY  4.E5  1.E6  4.E6  1.E7        Earth layer boundaries (cm)
SEED    1   0   0                      seed for 1st RNG
SEED    2   0   0                      seed for 2nd RNG
SEED    3   0   0                      seed for 3rd RNG
SEED    4   0   0                      seed for 4th RNG
DEBUG   F  6  F  1000000
EXIT
